[node name="InfoText" type="RichTextLabel" parent="GuideModal/Panel/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[color=#66d9ef][b]🕹️ CONTROLS[/b][/color]
• [b]WASD / Arrows[/b] — Move
• [b]Shift / K / C[/b] — Dash / Dodge (Invulnerability frames)
• [b]Left Click / Space / J[/b] — Attack with sword slash
• [b]E[/b] — Open Victory Buff Chests
• [b]R[/b] — Restart run (Clears all data)

[color=#e6db74][b]🧠 THE AI DIRECTOR[/b][/color]
The dungeon watches your every move in real time!
• Overuse dodging left or right? Enemies predict your movement.
• Running away repeatedly? The Director triggers speed debuffs.
• Predictable rhythms? Mobs accelerate to break your cadence.

[color=#a6e22e][b]🛡️ ROOM BUFFS & SURVIVAL[/b][/color]
• Clear all enemies in a room to unlock its unique Victory Chest!
• [b]Room 1[/b]: +8 Attack Damage | [b]Room 2[/b]: +20% Damage Resistance
• [b]Room 3[/b]: +35 Movement Speed | [b]Room 4[/b]: +20 Max HP & Full Heal
• [b]Survival Aid[/b]: Entering a new floor below 75% HP restores +20 HP!

[color=#f92672][b]⚔️ THE DARK WIZARD (BOSS)[/b][/color]
Beware: The Final Boss has a [b]40% chance on hit[/b] to shatter one of your buffs!"

